\small
$y_i=\sum_{j=0}^{n-1}A_{ij}x_j,\qquad x\cdot y=\sum_i x_i y_i$
`
opr juxtaposition(A:Mat,x:Vec):Vec = Vec(A.m,fn i => SUM[j <- 0#A.n] A[i,j] x[j])
opr DOT(x:Vec,y:Vec):V = SUM[i <- 0#x.n] x[i] y[i]
`
